          "target": "msg[] array @0x4060 (OOB read to obtain pointer), msg_size[] array @0x4160 (OOB read to obtain size), heap buffer pointed by OOB-obtained pointer (OOB write in edit_cookie)",
          "size": "edit_cookie: up to msg_size[index]-1 bytes written to OOB-obtained pointer; read_cookie: unbounded string read via printf %s"
        },
        "impact": [
